df","index":6,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":4466522,"width":1412,"height":1868,"pagecount":36,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_%28IA_CAT109916907931007426138%29.pdf/page1-1280px-Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_%28IA_CAT109916907931007426138%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":2117,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_%28IA_CAT109916907931007426138%29.pdf/page1-1280px-Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_%28IA_CAT109916907931007426138%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":2117},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_%28IA_CAT109916907931007426138%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fordson_Tractor_Parts_Price_List_Model_N_(IA_CAT109916907931007426138).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=193434694","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>12.5 linear feet (12 boxes)\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Materials consist of over 400 catalogs, almanacs, pamphlets, magazines, and newspapers from the 19th and 20th centuries. Topics include poultry and other livestock, animal treatments, and farming equipment, manuals, and techniques. Arranged alphabetically by company name</dd>\n<dd>Box 1 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 2 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 3 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 4 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 5 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 6 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 7 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 8 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 9 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 10 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0:</dd>\n<dd>Box 11 includes publications produced by the following companies\u00a0: Unadilla Silo Company, United Brooder Company, United States Shipping Board, Universal Crusher Company, The Universal Milking Machine Co., Vermont Farm Machine Co., Virginia-Carolina Chemical Company, Walker Remedy Company, The Warder, Bushnell &amp; Glessner Company, J. J. Warren, The Warsaw-Wilkinson Company, Washington Co-operative Egg and Poultry Association, The J. R. Watkins Medical Company, The J. R. Watkins Company, W. A. Weber, Wedge-Wood Poultry Farm &amp; Hatcheries, Inc., Wehman Bros., Wene Chick Farms, The Charles Williams Store, Williams, Clark &amp; Company, H. E. Williamson, Wilmer Atkinson Company, Wirthmore Pellets, and Wirthmore Feeds</dd>\n<dd>Box 12 includes 24 issues of The Poultry Messenger &amp; Western Fruit-Grower, a monthly publication produced by the Messenger Company in Aurelia, Iowa</dd>\n<dd>Livestock and farm trade publications collection. Special Collections, USDA National Agricultural Library</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: United States.--Department of Agriculture--History--Archives.; Agriculture--United States--History--Archives.; National Agricultural Library (U.S.).--Special Collections--Catalogs and collections.; National Agricultural Library (U.S.).--Special Collections; United States.--Department of Agriculture; Advertising--Agriculture--United States.; Agricultural machinery--United States--Catalogs.; Agriculture--United States--Handbooks, manuals, etc.; Farm equipment--United States--Catalogs.; Farm supplies--United States--Catalogs.; Livestock--United States--Equipment and supplies--Catalogs.; Livestock--United States--Handbooks, manuals, etc.; Poultry--Breeding--United States--Handbooks, manuals, etc.; Agriculture; United States; Archives; Catalogs and collections; History; Sales catalogs.; Almanacs.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/CAT109916907931007426138\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:CAT109916907931007426138\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier:</bdi> CAT109916907931007426138</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/CAT109916907931007426138/CAT109916907931007426138.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/CAT109916907931007426138/CAT109916907931007426138.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}},"mime":"application/pdf"}]},"98581345":{"pageid":98581345,"ns":6,"title":"File:History of Norfolk County, Massachusetts, with biographical sketches of many of its pioneers and prominent men (IA historyofnorfolk00hurd).pdf","index":47,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":131191218,"width":956,"height":1558,"pagecount":1308,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/History_of_Norfolk_County%2C_Massachusetts%2C_with_biographical_sketches_of_many_of_its_pioneers_and_prominent_men_%28IA_historyofnorfolk00hurd%29.pdf/page1-500px-History_of_Norfolk_County%2C_Massachusetts%2C_with_biographical_sketches_of_many_of_its_pioneers_and_prominent_men_%28IA_historyofnorfolk00hurd%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1600,"thumbheight":2608,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia